      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ADHANA SNAG (6) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 30.76 beating Error Code. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. ICE COOL BLUE (8) has been out of the placings the last couple but was a Grade 6 winner (17.25) three back at Murray Bridge Straight. Has good speed and can quickly clear the pack out wide. Can hit the frame this time. YARRAMUNDI COCO (3) gave a start after copping a check in running and missed the frame when a 11 length fourth (35.30) at this track in a Grade 6/MDN. Has the ability and can atone with the right run. MISS SINCLAIR (2) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
